<div xmlns:perseus="http://www.perseus.org/meta/perseus.rdfs#" xmlns:dctype="http://purl.org/dc/dcmitype/" xmlns:tufts="http://www.tufts.edu/" xmlns:alph="http://alpheios.net/namespaces/tei" class="alpheios-lex-text_container en">
    <div class="alpheios-lex-entry" lemma-id="n23628" body-key=""><b><span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">δέ-ησις</span></b> , <span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">εως</span>, ἡ, <div class="alpheios-lex-lex_sense alpheios-lex-lex_sense1"><b>A.</b><i>entreaty,</i>
			<i><span class="en">
				Lys.
				2.15
			</span></i> (pl.), <i><span class="en">
				Isoc.
				8.138
			</span></i> (pl.), <i><span class="en">
				Pl.
				<u>Ep.</u>
				329d
			</span></i> (pl.), etc.; 
				“<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">δέομαι δ᾽ ὑμῶν . . δικαίαν δέησιν</span>”
				 <i><span class="en">
					D.
					29.4
				</span></i>
			; 
				“<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">δεήσεις ποιεῖσθαι</span>”
				 <i><span class="en">
					<u>Ev.Luc.</u>
					5.33
				</span></i>
			, cf. Wilcken <i><span class="en">
				<u>Chr.</u>
				41 ii 12
			</span></i>
			<span class="entity">(iii A.D.)</span>. </div>
        <div class="alpheios-lex-lex_sense alpheios-lex-lex_sense3"><b>2.</b> written <i>petition,</i>
			<i><span class="en">
				CPHerm.
				6.10
			</span></i>, <i><span class="en">
				J.
				<u>BJ</u>
				7.5.2
			</span></i>, <i><span class="en">
				Ph.
				2.586
			</span></i>, <i><span class="en">
				<u>PGen.</u>
				16.10
			</span></i>
			<span class="entity">(iii A.D.)</span>. </div>
        <div class="alpheios-lex-lex_sense alpheios-lex-lex_sense2"><b>II.</b>
			<i>want, need,</i>
			<i><span class="en">
				Antipho Soph.
				11
			</span></i>; 
				“<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">ἐν ἐπιθυμίαις τε καὶ δεήσεσιν</span>”
				 <i><span class="en">
					Pl.
					<u>Erx.</u>
					405e
				</span></i>
			; <span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">κατὰ τὰς δεήσεις</span>
			according to their <i>needs,</i>
			<i><span class="en">
				Arist.
				<u>Pol.</u>
				1257a23
			</span></i>; 
				“<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">δεήσεις εἰσὶν αἱ ὀρέξεις</span>”
				 <i><span class="en">
					Id.
					<u>Rh.</u>
					1385a22
				</span></i>
			.</div>
